============================================
  logical operators in MongoDB
============================================

syntax: db.collection.find({<$logical_operators>:[{expression1},{expression2},...]})

-> $or - performs  logical OR no array of two or more atlist one expression must be true to return the document 

example: db.books.find({$or:[{no_of_reviews:{$gt:3}},{tags:"programming"}]}) 

